WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.017 --> 00:00:02.531
This is where your words go.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:06.451
Most of the time, you already know what you want to say.

3
00:00:08.617 --> 00:00:10.857
With Whisperly, you hold a key and say it.

4
00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:15.849
Let go, and the words appear at your cursor, in whatever app you're using.

5
00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:20.015
All of it happens on your computer.

6
00:00:20.983 --> 00:00:26.381
The recording goes from the microphone to a speech engine on the same machine, and it never leaves.

7
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.038
There's no account, and nothing to sign in to.

8
00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.983
A small capsule shows you what it's doing.

9
00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:38.609
If the microphone hears nothing, it says so. Escape cancels.

10
00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:45.099
And if you switch windows before the text is ready, it's copied, not typed into the wrong place.

11
00:00:46.967 --> 00:00:52.748
You choose the model that suits your computer, from 75 to 466 megabytes.

12
00:00:53.717 --> 00:00:56.021
Each download is checked before it's used.

13
00:00:58.533 --> 00:01:03.952
On Windows, it understands a hundred languages, and writes Danish the way Danes write it.

14
00:01:07.217 --> 00:01:10.779
Teach it the names and words you use, and it spells them your way.

15
00:01:13.917 --> 00:01:18.567
Everything you dictate is kept in a history on your computer, ready to use again.

16
00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:23.734
Whisperly is for Windows and Mac.

17
00:01:26.883 --> 00:01:28.846
Hold a key. Say it. Let go.
